{"name":"Agile Chassis","type":"ancestry","img":"icons/commodities/tech/circuit-board.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"agile-chassis","description":{"value":"<p>Agile Chassis</p><p><strong>Support Benefit:</strong> An item or weapon carried by the robot is launched up to 20 feet into the air; you Interact to catch it.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver:</strong> Surgical Strike</p><p>Шасси и продвинутый манёвр доступны как собственные нативные Items модуля. Основные параметры, скорости, чувства, навыки и поддерживаемые Strikes задаются Rule Elements. Сам текст преимущества поддержки и правила продвинутого манёвра не равны полной автоматизации их эффектов.</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#agile-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["construct","robot","tech"],"otherTags":[]},"hp":6,"size":"med","speed":40,"reach":5,"vision":"low-light-vision","boosts":{"0":{"value":[]},"1":{"value":[]},"2":{"value":[]}},"flaws":{"0":{"value":[]}},"languages":{"value":[],"custom":""},"additionalLanguages":{"count":0,"value":[],"custom":""},"items":{},"rules":[{"key":"GrantItem","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.KKOgokqHa7RjVDN6","flag":"techPetCompanionClass","allowDuplicate":false},{"key":"ActorTraits","add":["construct","robot","tech"],"remove":["animal"]},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.dex.mod","value":3},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.con.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.int.mod","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.wis.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.cha.mod","value":-1},{"key":"BaseSpeed","selector":"climb","value":20},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.skills.stealth.rank","value":1},{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"chassisSize","adjustName":false,"prompt":"SFMTP.ChooseSize","choices":[{"value":"sm","label":"SFMTP.Size.sm"},{"value":"med","label":"SFMTP.Size.med"}]},{"key":"CreatureSize","value":"{item|flags.sf2e.rulesSelections.chassisSize}"},{"key":"Strike","slug":"blade","category":"unarmed","label":"Blade","group":"brawling","replaceBasicUnarmed":true,"traits":["unarmed","agile","finesse","versatile-p"],"range":null,"damage":{"base":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"slashing"}}}]},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"agile-chassis"},"sf2e":{"rulesSelections":{"chassisSize":null}}},"_id":"665ae48461a79f96"}
{"name":"Imitator Chassis","type":"ancestry","img":"icons/commodities/tech/circuit-board.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"imitator-chassis","description":{"value":"<p>Choose one ancestry or animal. The robot has that species’ size and Speeds and looks like it. Choose one unarmed attack from that species; the robot uses agile and finesse and deals 1d4 damage.</p><p><strong>Support Benefit:</strong> Focuses on a target within the first range increment or reach; your damaging Strikes against it make it @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard} until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver:</strong> Disturbing Display</p><p>Шасси и продвинутый манёвр доступны как собственные нативные Items модуля. Основные параметры, скорости, чувства, навыки и поддерживаемые Strikes задаются Rule Elements. Сам текст преимущества поддержки и правила продвинутого манёвра не равны полной автоматизации их эффектов.</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#imitator-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["construct","robot","tech"],"otherTags":[]},"hp":4,"size":"med","speed":25,"reach":5,"vision":"low-light-vision","boosts":{"0":{"value":[]},"1":{"value":[]},"2":{"value":[]}},"flaws":{"0":{"value":[]}},"languages":{"value":[],"custom":""},"additionalLanguages":{"count":0,"value":[],"custom":""},"items":{},"rules":[{"key":"GrantItem","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.KKOgokqHa7RjVDN6","flag":"techPetCompanionClass","allowDuplicate":false},{"key":"ActorTraits","add":["construct","robot","tech"],"remove":["animal"]},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.dex.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.con.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.int.mod","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.wis.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.cha.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.skills.deception.rank","value":1}]},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"imitator-chassis"},"sf2e":{"rulesSelections":{"chassisSize":null}}},"_id":"ffbec81b0ad2c821"}
{"name":"Powerful Chassis","type":"ancestry","img":"icons/commodities/tech/circuit-board.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"powerful-chassis","description":{"value":"<p>Powerful Chassis</p><p><strong>Support Benefit:</strong> Until the start of your next turn, your Strikes that damage creatures within the robot companion&#39;s melee reach also deal 1d6 persistent bleed damage (2d6 if burly or deft).</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver:</strong> Hydraulic Flipper</p><p>Шасси и продвинутый манёвр доступны как собственные нативные Items модуля. Основные параметры, скорости, чувства, навыки и поддерживаемые Strikes задаются Rule Elements. Сам текст преимущества поддержки и правила продвинутого манёвра не равны полной автоматизации их эффектов.</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#powerful-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["construct","robot","tech"],"otherTags":[]},"hp":8,"size":"med","speed":30,"reach":5,"vision":"low-light-vision","boosts":{"0":{"value":[]},"1":{"value":[]},"2":{"value":[]}},"flaws":{"0":{"value":[]}},"languages":{"value":[],"custom":""},"additionalLanguages":{"count":0,"value":[],"custom":""},"items":{},"rules":[{"key":"GrantItem","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.KKOgokqHa7RjVDN6","flag":"techPetCompanionClass","allowDuplicate":false},{"key":"ActorTraits","add":["construct","robot","tech"],"remove":["animal"]},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":3},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.dex.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.con.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.int.mod","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.wis.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.cha.mod","value":-1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.skills.intimidation.rank","value":1},{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"chassisSize","adjustName":false,"prompt":"SFMTP.ChooseSize","choices":[{"value":"med","label":"SFMTP.Size.med"},{"value":"lg","label":"SFMTP.Size.lg"}]},{"key":"CreatureSize","value":"{item|flags.sf2e.rulesSelections.chassisSize}"},{"key":"Strike","slug":"hydraulic-fist","category":"unarmed","label":"Hydraulic fist","group":"brawling","replaceBasicUnarmed":true,"traits":["unarmed"],"range":null,"damage":{"base":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}},{"key":"Strike","slug":"serrated-blade","category":"unarmed","label":"Serrated blade","group":"brawling","replaceBasicUnarmed":true,"traits":["unarmed"],"range":null,"damage":{"base":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"slashing"}}}]},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"powerful-chassis"},"sf2e":{"rulesSelections":{"chassisSize":null}}},"_id":"732e951efdaac285"}
{"name":"Surveillance Chassis","type":"ancestry","img":"icons/commodities/tech/circuit-board.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"surveillance-chassis","description":{"value":"<p>Surveillance Chassis</p><p><strong>Support Benefit:</strong> Until the end of your next turn, creatures adjacent to the robot can’t flank you or make you @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard}.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver:</strong> Blinding Spotlight</p><p>Шасси и продвинутый манёвр доступны как собственные нативные Items модуля. Основные параметры, скорости, чувства, навыки и поддерживаемые Strikes задаются Rule Elements. Сам текст преимущества поддержки и правила продвинутого манёвра не равны полной автоматизации их эффектов.</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#surveillance-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["construct","robot","tech"],"otherTags":[]},"hp":4,"size":"sm","speed":25,"reach":5,"vision":"darkvision","boosts":{"0":{"value":[]},"1":{"value":[]},"2":{"value":[]}},"flaws":{"0":{"value":[]}},"languages":{"value":[],"custom":""},"additionalLanguages":{"count":0,"value":[],"custom":""},"items":{},"rules":[{"key":"GrantItem","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.KKOgokqHa7RjVDN6","flag":"techPetCompanionClass","allowDuplicate":false},{"key":"ActorTraits","add":["construct","robot","tech"],"remove":["animal"]},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":0},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.dex.mod","value":3},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.con.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.int.mod","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.wis.mod","value":3},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.cha.mod","value":0},{"key":"BaseSpeed","selector":"fly","value":20},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.skills.stealth.rank","value":1},{"key":"Strike","slug":"spark","category":"unarmed","label":"Spark","group":"brawling","replaceBasicUnarmed":true,"traits":["unarmed"],"range":{"increment":30},"damage":{"base":{"dice":1,"die":"d4","damageType":"electricity"}}}]},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"surveillance-chassis"},"sf2e":{"rulesSelections":{"chassisSize":null}}},"_id":"7b04d902728ef7d1"}
{"name":"Tank Chassis","type":"ancestry","img":"icons/commodities/tech/circuit-board.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"tank-chassis","description":{"value":"<p>Tank Chassis</p><p><strong>Support Benefit:</strong> Gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next Strike against a foe within the robot’s melee reach; it ends after the Strike or at the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver:</strong> Ram Slam</p><p>Шасси и продвинутый манёвр доступны как собственные нативные Items модуля. Основные параметры, скорости, чувства, навыки и поддерживаемые Strikes задаются Rule Elements. Сам текст преимущества поддержки и правила продвинутого манёвра не равны полной автоматизации их эффектов.</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#tank-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["construct","robot","tech"],"otherTags":[]},"hp":10,"size":"med","speed":20,"reach":5,"vision":"low-light-vision","boosts":{"0":{"value":[]},"1":{"value":[]},"2":{"value":[]}},"flaws":{"0":{"value":[]}},"languages":{"value":[],"custom":""},"additionalLanguages":{"count":0,"value":[],"custom":""},"items":{},"rules":[{"key":"GrantItem","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.KKOgokqHa7RjVDN6","flag":"techPetCompanionClass","allowDuplicate":false},{"key":"ActorTraits","add":["construct","robot","tech"],"remove":["animal"]},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.dex.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.con.mod","value":3},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.int.mod","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.wis.mod","value":2},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.cha.mod","value":-1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.skills.intimidation.rank","value":1},{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"chassisSize","adjustName":false,"prompt":"SFMTP.ChooseSize","choices":[{"value":"med","label":"SFMTP.Size.med"},{"value":"lg","label":"SFMTP.Size.lg"}]},{"key":"CreatureSize","value":"{item|flags.sf2e.rulesSelections.chassisSize}"},{"key":"Strike","slug":"battering-ram","category":"unarmed","label":"Battering ram","group":"brawling","replaceBasicUnarmed":true,"traits":["unarmed","shove"],"range":null,"damage":{"base":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}}]},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"tank-chassis"},"sf2e":{"rulesSelections":{"chassisSize":null}}},"_id":"2b1b2bfd08e957b2"}
